long-standing caveats queryable instead of prose: hiot:alsoDeployedIn Prosumer,
Commercial and hiot:consumerAvailability MixedChannel encode the pro-surveillance
contamination the scope note describes and that the human reviewers settled by
consumer-availability; hiot:hasWebAdminUI true and hiot:computeTier EmbeddedLinux
